          "distinct": true,
          "id": "8d5248bee605aa75b5053e6791e4f2a878072819",
          "message": "🚨 Test: race in session middleware tests (#2740)\n\nA Session must not be accessed after Save() is called, but a unit test\r\ncalls Session.ID() after Session.Save(), sometimes causing the test to\r\nfail when -race is enabled. The assertions that ID() was being used in\r\nwere redundant with the previous two assertions (checking that the\r\nsession name header is empty), so we can just remove the offending code.",
          "timestamp": "2023-11-27T14:38:31+01:00",
          "tree_id": "f19c7574dac5fe8ca17e4ec8540cd2e4c0018050",
          "url": "https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/commit/8d5248bee605aa75b5053e6791e4f2a878072819"
